{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746380/extras/40400BD9CAF49BAA964560997A43AA72.png?t=1748793421\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;CatCat&quot; is a relaxing cat simulation game. Raise different breeds, feed them, and pet them. You can freely change the layout, arrange furniture, and alter wall colors to create a cozy space for you and your cats. There are no goals or pressure; just enjoy a peaceful time together with your cats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cute electronic kitten</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game you can get cat eggs and hatch different breeds of cats by cleaning up poop and clumps of fur, or destroying furniture. Feed them and wait for them to grow, and they will give you little surprises too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746380/extras/5\u670828\u65e5_1___2_.gif?t=1748793421\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customized rooms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have the freedom to place flooring in your space and fill every corner with furniture. Match different floor and wall textures to create a unique space atmosphere. Create a unique and cozy living environment for your cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746380/extras/5\u670828\u65e5__1__7_.gif?t=1748793421\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Different types of props</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Capture Twister sprites to discover a huge variety of furniture and props and collect them to fill your iconography. Or interact with them to see what chemistry can be created?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746380/extras/5\u670828\u65e5__1__5_.gif?t=1748793421\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/i